{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 35, :comments ["<b>And its sound shall be heard.</b> So that they know the time of the service and thereby direct their hearts to their Father in heaven. Another interpretation: <b>and its sound shall be heard</b> — so that he be distinguished and set apart as most holy among the rest of the priests serving there. But on Yom HaKippurim he did not need the bells, since all services are valid only through him."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:00:57.406756510Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}